        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7103815",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Zhiqiong, who has woken up",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710380707"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710380707": {
            "id": "710380707",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Jinwu made this...? Thank you... and please help me thank Jinwu and the others, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710380708"
            ]
          },
          "710380708": {
            "id": "710380708",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I'll be fine, I just need to get some sleep and I'll be good as new...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710380709"
            ]
          },
          "710380709": {
            "id": "710380709",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I'm really very sorry... *cough* Could you please come back again in a bit?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7103604",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710360401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710360401": {
            "id": "710360401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Hello there! Have a seat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360402"
            ]
          },
          "710360402": {
            "id": "710360402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about our previous adventure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360403"
            ]
          },
          "710360403": {
            "id": "710360403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Ah, are you trying to ask why I was so stubborn or why I gave everyone so much trouble? Haha, come on, I know I was wrong... you don't have to keep harping on it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360404"
            ]
          },
          "710360404": {
            "id": "710360404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "But to be honest, I suspect that it's in our nature as adventurers to be fascinated with danger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360405"
            ]
          },
          "710360405": {
            "id": "710360405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I mean, we were born with strong backs and agile limbs. It just feels... wrong, you know? To have these tools but be content with a placid existence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360406"
            ]
          },
          "710360406": {
            "id": "710360406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "As for mortal peril, it's not that I haven't given it any consideration, but... Hmm, could I ask you a question?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360407"
            ]
          },
          "710360407": {
            "id": "710360407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Ask away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360408"
            ]
          },
          "710360408": {
            "id": "710360408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "The famous adventurer Stanley of Mondstadt is so famed because he passed through the Mare Jivari, but he lost a dear friend during that adventure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360409"
            ]
          },
          "710360409": {
            "id": "710360409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Even though few people know what the name of that friend was, the memory of him stays with us adventurers because he went on that adventure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360410"
            ]
          },
          "710360410": {
            "id": "710360410",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I was thinking... and please, don't laugh if you find me immature. Do you think that this friend of Stanley's, who did not return, has not in fact passed on, but instead can be said to be truly \"alive\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360412",
              "710360415",
              "710360419"
            ]
          },
          "710360412": {
            "id": "710360412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "But to be remembered... Even if you were to pass on early, would that not be considered an extension of your life?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360413"
            ]
          },
          "710360413": {
            "id": "710360413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "You would live on in a different fashion, in the admiration, memories... in the eyes of others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360422"
            ]
          },
          "710360422": {
            "id": "710360422",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't be so concerned about what other people think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360423"
            ]
          },
          "710360423": {
            "id": "710360423",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "That's what a lot of people have told me. \"Be yourself,\" \"just do your job\"... These things sound like guidance, but really, they're asking me to give up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360424"
            ]
          },
          "710360424": {
            "id": "710360424",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I've said before, I think, but I don't go on adventures for anyone else... or for myself, even.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360425"
            ]
          },
          "710360425": {
            "id": "710360425",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Hmm, have you thought about this before?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360426"
            ]
          },
          "710360426": {
            "id": "710360426",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "This world has been ordered by the gods, and though we ordinary mortals have not been given \"eyes\" by them, we nonetheless do not wish to go quietly and be forgotten just like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360427"
            ]
          },
          "710360427": {
            "id": "710360427",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I believe that this discontent is not meaningless, and that's why I go around exploring dangerous areas. I mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360428"
            ]
          },
          "710360428": {
            "id": "710360428",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I mean, to wrestle with things that even the gods would fear with our frail forms... isn't that what makes us \"human\"? That's what I believe."
          },
          "710360415": {
            "id": "710360415",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Well... I've never thought of living a \"successful\" life. Rather, even if I \"fail,\" I would like to leave an impression on others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360416"
            ]
          },
          "710360416": {
            "id": "710360416",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "At least they would say, \"Zhiqiong also did once face the challenges of The Chasm!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360417"
            ]
          },
          "710360417": {
            "id": "710360417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "At least then, I wouldn't be forgotten like those who sacrificed themselves in deserted places, or... you know, like me now."
          },
          "710360419": {
            "id": "710360419",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Is that so...? I guess that might be because an outsider like you naturally becomes the topic of conversation no matter where you go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360420"
            ]
          },
          "710360420": {
            "id": "710360420",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "I suppose it's like how children born with golden spoons in their mouths might find the idea of poverty to be an exciting, but ultimately unnecessary, avenue for adventure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710360421"
            ]
          },
          "710360421": {
            "id": "710360421",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Zhiqiong",
            "text": "Ah, uh, sorry... I didn't mean it like that. I was just saying... Never mind. Just forget I said anything."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}